usage: test_startup_shutdown_e2e.py [-h] --source SOURCE --output OUTPUT
                                    [--case {all,ordering}]

First observable binding and stopping an owned daemon with a waiting run. Real
CLI/socket/daemon/gates/Git/SQLite; PTY callbacks and process facts are
scripted in the host. No Codex, credentials or model turns. Distinct failures:
pre-input native log prerequisite, no deferred binding, busy stop during run
wait, busy stop during deadline cleanup, or shutdown claiming acceptance.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --source SOURCE
  --output OUTPUT
  --case {all,ordering}
